# {{ theme.name }} tmux Theme

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This repository is a read-only mirror.
> Issues, pull requests, and stars should go to [{{ slug }}]({{ theme.repository }}).

tmux themes for {{ theme.name }}. {{ theme.description }}

## Installation

### Using TPM (recommended)

Add to your `.tmux.conf`:

```tmux
set -g @plugin '{{ owner }}/{{ theme.id }}-tmux'
set -g @{{ theme.id }}_variant '{{ first.variant.id }}'{% if variants | length > 1 %}  #{% for v in variants | slice(start=1) %} or '{{ v.variant.id }}'{% endfor %}{% endif %}
```

Then press `prefix + I` to install.

To pin a specific version:

```tmux
set -g @plugin '{{ owner }}/{{ theme.id }}-tmux#v0.9.0'
```

### Manual

Download the theme file and source it in your `.tmux.conf`:

```tmux
source-file /path/to/{{ theme.id }}-{{ first.variant.id }}.conf
```

