## Features

### Prefix Indicator

The status bar icon changes when you press the prefix key:

- 󰛩 - Normal mode (outline)
- 󰛨 - Prefix mode (filled)

## Options

| Option | Default | Description |
|--------|---------|-------------|
| `@{{ theme.id }}_variant` | `{{ first.variant.id }}` | Theme variant (`{{ first.variant.id }}`{% for v in variants | slice(start=1) %} or `{{ v.variant.id }}`{% endfor %}) |
| `@{{ theme.id }}_icon_normal` | `󰛩` | Icon shown in normal mode |
| `@{{ theme.id }}_icon_prefix` | `󰛨` | Icon shown when prefix is pressed |

### Example: Custom Icons

```tmux
set -g @{{ theme.id }}_icon_normal ''
set -g @{{ theme.id }}_icon_prefix ''
```
